@baseUrl = http://localhost:5081

### Process liveness; does not check SQL Server or Exchange
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Requires a client that sends Windows credentials (see Backend/README.md)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me
Accept: application/json

### Development only: real SQL connection; requires Windows credentials
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/diagnostics/database
Accept: application/json

### Current employee's theme; requires Windows credentials
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/user-settings/theme

### Available active themes, ordered by DisplayOrder (requires Windows credentials)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/themes

### Save current employee's theme (no UserId/NTName in the body)
# Replace 2 with an actual themeId from GET /api/themes; display order is not the ID.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/user-settings/theme
Content-Type: application/json
X-CompanyPortal-Request: theme

{"themeId":2}
